## 关键代码示例

### 1. 选课核心业务逻辑
```java
@Transactional
public void selectCourse(Integer studentId, Integer courseId) {
    // 6步验证链，确保数据一致性
    // 1. 检查重复选课
    if (hasSelected(studentId, courseId)) {
        throw new BusinessException("您已选过该课程");
    }
    
    // 2. 检查选课数量上限
    if (getSelectedCount(studentId) >= 5) {
        throw new BusinessException("选课已达上限");
    }
    
    // 3. 检查课程状态
    Course course = getCourseById(courseId);
    if (course == null || course.getStatus() == 0) {
        throw new BusinessException("课程不存在或已停用");
    }
    
    // 4. 检查时间冲突
    if (hasTimeConflict(studentId, course.getSchedule())) {
        throw new BusinessException("上课时间冲突");
    }
    
    // 5. 检查课程容量
    if (course.getSelected() >= course.getCapacity()) {
        throw new BusinessException("课程已满员");
    }
    
    // 6. 执行选课操作
    executeSelection(studentId, courseId);
    
    // 7. 异步发送通知
    sendSelectionNotification(studentId, courseId);
}
```

### 2. 权限控制实现
```java
@RestController
@RequestMapping("/api/admin")
@PreAuthorize("hasAnyAuthority('admin:menu:manage','admin:notice:manage')")
public class AdminController {

    @PostMapping("/notice/add")
    public Result<?> addNotice(@RequestBody Notice notice,
                              @RequestHeader(value = "Authorization") String authHeader) {
        // 从Token中获取用户信息
        String token = authHeader.substring(7);
        String username = jwtUtil.getUsernameFromToken(token);
        User user = userService.getUserByUsername(username);
        
        // 设置公告作者
        notice.setAuthor(user.getRole() == 0 ? "教务处" : user.getRealName());
        
        // 保存公告
        noticeService.addNotice(notice);
        return Result.success();
    }
}
```

### 3. 缓存与数据库同步
```java
@Service
public class CourseService {

    @Cacheable(value = "availableCourses", key = "#term")
    public List<Course> getAvailableCoursesByTerm(String term) {
        log.info("🔴 [Redis] 缓存未命中 availableCourses::{}，从 MySQL 查询", term);
        return courseMapper.selectAvailableByTerm(term);
    }

    @CacheEvict(value = {"course", "availableCourses"}, allEntries = true)
    public void updateCourseStatus(Integer courseId, Integer status) {
        Course course = courseMapper.selectById(courseId);
        if (course != null) {
            course.setStatus(status);
            courseMapper.updateById(course);
            log.info("🔴 [Redis] 清除所有课程缓存（原因：课程状态变更）");
        }
    }
}
```

